aintenance','Maintenance Tab'=>'Maintenance Tab','Make casual'=>'Make casual','Make concise'=>'Make concise','Make formal'=>'Make formal','Mark citations needed'=>'Mark citations needed','Max context characters'=>'Max context characters','Max hints characters'=>'Max hints characters','Max input characters'=>'Max input characters','Max output tokens'=>'Max output tokens','Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000.'=>'Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000.','Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000.'=>'Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000.','Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000.'=>'Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000.','Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed.'=>'Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed.','Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. Default: 16 000.'=>'Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. Default: 16 000.','Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192.'=>'Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192.','Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000.'=>'Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000.','Meta Description'=>'Meta Description','Meta Description, Excerpt Generator'=>'Meta Description, Excerpt Generator','Minimum role'=>'Minimum role','Missing pattern name or language.'=>'Missing pattern name or language.','Mode'=>'Mode','Model'=>'Model','Model tier'=>'Model tier','Models'=>'Models','Models Tab (General)'=>'Models Tab (General)','Most recent cached block'=>'Most recent cached block','Most recent cached response'=>'Most recent cached response','Multilingual routing, SEO meta tags, and AI content tools for WordPress. Combines language detection, URL routing, hreflang, meta descriptions, and AI-powered excerpt, meta, and translation features.'=>'Multilingual routing, SEO meta tags, and AI content tools for WordPress. Combines language detection, URL routing, hreflang, meta descriptions, and AI-powered excerpt, meta, and translation features.','Name displayed in this language. Leave empty to use the source name.'=>'Name displayed in this language. Leave empty to use the source name.','Navigation'=>'Navigation','Navigation has no content to translate.'=>'Navigation has no content to translate.','Navigation not found.'=>'Navigation not found.','Navigation posts are translated via the Router tab, not this button.'=>'Navigation posts are translated via the Router tab, not this button.','Navigation translation requires an active AI provider. Configure an API key in the API Keys tab.'=>'Navigation translation requires an active AI provider. Configure an API key in the API Keys tab.','Navigations'=>'Navigations','Network error — could not reach the WordPress AJAX endpoint.'=>'Network error — could not reach the WordPress AJAX endpoint.','No %s version found in this translation group.'=>'No %s version found in this translation group.','No AI provider configured.'=>'No AI provider configured.','No AI usage recorded in the selected window (%s). Pick a wider range above.'=>'No AI usage recorded in the selected window (%s). Pick a wider range above.','No AI usage recorded yet. Once an editor runs a translation, generates a meta description, or uses any other AI feature, totals will appear here.'=>'No AI usage recorded yet. Once an editor runs a translation, generates a meta description, or uses any other AI feature, totals will appear here.','No API key configured for this provider.'=>'No API key configured for this provider.','No built-in instructions — each AI feature uses its own tuned defaults. Fill in the Custom prompt instructions field below to add your own site-wide rules.'=>'No built-in instructions — each AI feature uses its own tuned defaults. Fill in the Custom prompt instructions field below to add your own site-wide rules.','No custom Loco Translate files found yet. They appear here once you save a translation in Loco Translate.'=>'No custom Loco Translate files found yet. They appear here once you save a translation in Loco Translate.','No file was selected.'=>'No file was selected.','No glossary entries match the current filter. Clear the filter to see all entries, or add a new entry below.'=>'No glossary entries match the current filter. Clear the filter to see all entries, or add a new entry below.','No glossary entries yet. Add one below to start enforcing terminology in translations.'=>'No glossary entries yet. Add one below to start enforcing terminology in translations.','No internal links found to update.'=>'No internal links found to update.','No language-specific template parts found to map.'=>'No language-specific template parts found to map.','No navigation references needed updating.'=>'No navigation references needed updating.','No override files uploaded yet.'=>'No override files uploaded yet.','No response from provider — check the error log for details.'=>'No response from provider — check the error log for details.','No secondary languages configured. Install a language pack above to enable template scaffolding.'=>'No secondary languages configured. Install a language pack above to enable template scaffolding.','No source content found to translate.'=>'No source content found to translate.','No source page linked yet.'=>'No source page linked yet.','No template part references needed updating.'=>'No template part references needed updating.','No {lang} translation registered (TRID missing)'=>'No {lang} translation registered (TRID missing)','Notes'=>'Notes','Notice message'=>'Notice message','Notice settings'=>'Notice settings','Oldest cached block'=>'Oldest cached block','Oldest cached response'=>'Oldest cached response','Only .mo files are accepted.'=>'Only .mo files are accepted.','OpenAI (GPT)'=>'OpenAI (GPT)','Optional context for editors (e.g. "ASIC = Application-Specific Integrated Circuit; preserve in English in technical contexts").'=>'Optional context for editors (e.g. "ASIC = Application-Specific Integrated Circuit; preserve in English in technical contexts").','Output'=>'Output','Output tokens'=>'Output tokens','overridden'=>'overridden','Override file deleted.'=>'Override file deleted.','Override file uploaded successfully.'=>'Override file uploaded successfully.','Overrides the AI preset for Translation and Content Generation on this page. All other features always use the global preset.'=>'Overrides the AI preset for Translation and Content Generation on this page. All other features always use the global preset.','Overrides the AI preset for Translation and Content Generation on this page. Site-wide custom prompt instructions (Settings → Behavior) are always appended to every request regardless of this selection.'=>'Overrides the AI preset for Translation and Content Generation on this page. Site-wide custom prompt instructions (Settings → Behavior) are always appended to every request regardless of this selection.','Overview'=>'Overview','Page'=>'Page','Part'=>'Part','Paste a footnote, sentence, or any snippet here…'=>'Paste a footnote, sentence, or any snippet here…','Paste text, or select text in the editor first…'=>'Paste text, or select text in the editor first…','Paste text, or select text on the page first…'=>'Paste text, or select text on the page first…','Paste your API key…'=>'Paste your API key…','Path prefix — example.com/de/'=>'Path prefix — example.com/de/','Pattern'=>'Pattern','Pattern has no content to translate.'=>'Pattern has no content to translate.','Pattern not found.'=>'Pattern not found.','Pattern translated and saved. Copy the content into your CPT post via the block editor Pattern inserter or use it as a starting point for a Reusable Block.'=>'Pattern translated and saved. Copy the content into your CPT post via the block editor Pattern inserter or use it as a starting point for a Reusable Block.','Pattern translation failed.'=>'Pattern translation failed.','Per-post cache for AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, and content. Always active — no separate toggle required. Entries are invalidated automatically when the content or AI provider/model changes. Use the toolbar "↺ Re-translate" button or click Clear below to force a fresh API call.'=>'Per-post cache for AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, and content. Always active — no separate toggle required. Entries are invalidated automatically when the content or AI provider/model changes. Use the toolbar "↺ Re-translate" button or click Clear below to force a fresh API call.','Permalink rules flushed successfully.'=>'Permalink rules flushed successfully.','Permission denied.'=>'Permission denied.','Persuasive'=>'Persuasive','PHP constant'=>'PHP constant','Pin terms that must not be translated or must always be rendered in a specific way (e.g. brand names, product names, acronyms). Glossary constraints are injected into every AI translation request for all features: post translation, meta description, excerpt, and FSE template translation.'=>'Pin terms that must not be translated or must always be rendered in a specific way (e.g. brand names, product names, acronyms). Glossary constraints are injected into every AI translation request for all features: post translation, meta description, excerpt, and FSE template translation.','Plain language'=>'Plain language','Please enter some instructions first…'=>'Please enter some instructions first…','Please enter some text first…'=>'Please enter some text first…','Post'=>'Post','Post not found.'=>'Post not found.','Post Types'=>'Post Types','Prefilled from excerpt. Edit to override.'=>'Prefilled from excerpt. Edit to override.','Primary Language'=>'Primary Language','Primary language'=>'Primary language','Primary language saved.'=>'Primary language saved.','Primary language: the language your existing content is written in. All translations are produced from this language; changing it does not move or delete any posts.'=>'Primary language: the language your existing content is written in. All translations are produced from this language; changing it does not move or delete any posts.','Processing…'=>'Processing…','Provider'=>'Provider','Provider returned no text. Check the WordPress error log for the detailed failure reason.'=>'Provider returned no text. Check the WordPress error log for the detailed failure reason.','Quality'=>'Quality','Quality (default — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)'=>'Quality (default — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)','Quality (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)'=>'Quality (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)','Quality: used for post translation and content generation — higher quality, higher cost.'=>'Quality: used for post translation and content generation — higher quality, higher cost.','Quick Translate'=>'Quick Translate','Quick Translation'=>'Quick Translation','Quick Translation is used for snippet/chunk mode — short passages translated on demand from the toolbar, editor, or block popovers. It uses a separate, lighter configuration from the full-page translation to keep responses fast and cost-effective.'=>'Quick Translation is used for snippet/chunk mode — short passages translated on demand from the toolbar, editor, or block popovers. It uses a separate, lighter configuration from the full-page translation to keep responses fast and cost-effective.','Re-enables Gutenberg\'s canLockBlocks. Useful for editorial templates that need to prevent contributors from moving or deleting specific blocks.'=>'Re-enables Gutenberg\'s canLockBlocks. Useful for editorial templates that need to prevent contributors from moving or deleting specific blocks.','Re-enables supportsTemplateMode. Core to Full-Site-Editing workflows where post-level template overrides are intentional.'=>'Re-enables supportsTemplateMode. Core to Full-Site-Editing workflows where post-level template overrides are intentional.','Re-generates and updates the cached result.'=>'Re-generates and updates the cached result.','Re-scan'=>'Re-scan','Re-scanning…'=>'Re-scanning…','Re-translate'=>'Re-translate','Redirect visitors to their preferred language based on the browser\'s Accept-Language header'=>'Redirect visitors to their preferred language based on the browser\'s Accept-Language header','Refine further — e.g. "make it shorter" or "use a formal tone"…'=>'Refine further — e.g. "make it shorter" or "use a formal tone"…','Refine further:'=>'Refine further:','Refinement'=>'Refinement','Refinement failed — please try again.'=>'Refinement failed — please try again.','Refining…'=>'Refining…','Regenerates WordPress rewrite rules so URL prefixes, language-specific slugs, and archive rewrites are all in sync. Necessary after changing the primary language or adding new language support.'=>'Regenerates WordPress rewrite rules so URL prefixes, language-specific slugs, and archive rewrites are all in sync. Necessary after changing the primary language or adding new language support.','Remove stored key'=>'Remove stored key','Report an issue on GitHub'=>'Report an issue on GitHub','Request failed — please try again.'=>'Request failed — please try again.','Request failed.'=>'Request failed.','Request failed. Check your connection.'=>'Request failed. Check your connection.','Request failed. Please try again.'=>'Request failed. Please try again.','Requests'=>'Requests','Reset'=>'Reset','Result will appear here…'=>'Result will appear here…','Retranslate'=>'Retranslate','Retranslating…'=>'Retranslating…','Review carefully — links and slugs not updated.'=>'Review carefully — links and slugs not updated.','Review translation before applying'=>'Review translation before applying','Revise'=>'Revise','Revision'=>'Revision','Revision Type'=>'Revision Type','Router'=>'Router','Router Tab'=>'Router Tab','Save Debug Setting'=>'Save Debug Setting','Save Router Settings'=>'Save Router Settings','Save Settings'=>'Save Settings','Save the post to persist changes.'=>'Save the post to persist changes.','Save Uninstall Setting'=>'Save Uninstall Setting','Saved to the meta description field when you apply.'=>'Saved to the meta description field when you apply.','Scan failed: '=>'Scan failed: ','Scan request failed. Please try again.'=>'Scan request failed. Please try again.','Scanning posts for broken language links…'=>'Scanning posts for broken language links…','Search'=>'Search','Search Results'=>'Search Results','Security check failed — file path is not permitted.'=>'Security check failed — file path is not permitted.','Select a language to manage its FSE templates, template parts, and navigation menus.'=>'Select a language to manage its FSE templates, template parts, and navigation menus.','Select language'=>'Select language','SEO character-count info'=>'SEO character-count info','Server setup (subdomain)'=>'Server setup (subdomain)','Sets the default AI behaviour for all features site-wide. Individual posts can override this for Translation and Content Generation via the Lingua Forge meta box.'=>'Sets the default AI behaviour for all features site-wide. Individual posts can override this for Translation and Content Generation via the Lingua Forge meta box.','Settings'=>'Settings','Settings saved.'=>'Settings saved.','Show home link'=>'Show home link','Shown when no translation exists for the visitor\'s language.'=>'Shown when no translation exists for the visitor\'s language.','Single'=>'Single','Single %s'=>'Single %s','Single: %s'=>'Single: %s','Site-wide ceiling on AI requests per UTC day (counts both Toolbar translations and block revisions). Counter resets at UTC midnight. Set to 0 to disable the cap.'=>'Site-wide ceiling on AI requests per UTC day (counts both Toolbar translations and block revisions). Counter resets at UTC midnight. Set to 0 to disable the cap.','Size'=>'Size','Some link fixes failed.'=>'Some link fixes failed.','Some nav ref fixes failed.'=>'Some nav ref fixes failed.','Some part fixes failed.'=>'Some part fixes failed.','Some parts could not be created.'=>'Some parts could not be created.','Some templates could not be created.'=>'Some templates could not be created.','Some translations failed.'=>'Some translations failed.','Source file not found.'=>'Source file not found.','Source lang'=>'Source lang','Source language'=>'Source language','Source term'=>'Source term','Standard'=>'Standard','Standard uses each feature\'s own tuned temperature: Translation T=0.2 (precise), Quick Translate T=0.4, Content Generator T=0.6 (creative). The other presets apply a single fixed temperature across all features.'=>'Standard uses each feature\'s own tuned temperature: Translation T=0.2 (precise), Quick Translate T=0.4, Content Generator T=0.6 (creative). The other presets apply a single fixed temperature across all features.','Status'=>'Status','Status / Actions'=>'Status / Actions','Storytelling'=>'Storytelling','Strict-preservation mode for legal, regulatory, medical, or technical content. When on, every AI feature uses a low sampling temperature and appends the addendum below to its system prompt — terminology, article numbers, units, brand names, and regulatory language are preserved verbatim rather than paraphrased.'=>'Strict-preservation mode for legal, regulatory, medical, or technical content. When on, every AI feature uses a low sampling temperature and appends the addendum below to its system prompt — terminology, article numbers, units, brand names, and regulatory language are preserved verbatim rather than paraphrased.','Structured Outline'=>'Structured Outline','Subdomain mode requires your web server to point all language subdomains (e.g. de.example.com) to this WordPress installation. After switching modes, flush permalink rules and clear any caches. If your home URL includes www (e.g. www.example.com), use the lf_base_domain filter to set the bare apex domain so subdomains are constructed correctly.'=>'Subdomain mode requires your web server to point all language subdomains (e.g., de.example.com) to this WordPress installation. After switching modes, flush permalink rules and clear any caches. If your home URL includes www (e.g., www.example.com), use the lf_base_domain filter to set the bare apex domain so subdomains are constructed correctly.','Subdomain — de.example.com/'=>'Subdomain — de.example.com/','Supported providers: Anthropic (Claude), OpenAI (GPT), Google (Gemini). Only one provider is active at a time. Select the active provider on the General tab.'=>'Supported providers: Anthropic (Claude), OpenAI (GPT), Google (Gemini). Only one provider is active at a time. Select the active provider on the General tab.','T=%s'=>'T=%s','T=0.2–0.6, per feature'=>'T=0.2–0.6, per feature','Target lang'=>'Target lang','Target Language'=>'Target Language','Target language'=>'Target language','Target term'=>'Target term','Target: 140–160 chars for optimal SERP display'=>'Target: 140–160 chars for optimal SERP display','Technical'=>'Technical','Technical / Scientific'=>'Technical / Scientific','Technical / Scientific instructions'=>'Technical / Scientific instructions','Template "%s" already exists.'=>'Template "%s" already exists.','Template "{expected}" does not exist — create it in the Site Editor first.'=>'Template "{expected}" does not exist — create it in the Site Editor first.','Template has no content.'=>'Template has no content.','Template mode'=>'Template mode','Template not found or not stored in the database.'=>'Template not found or not stored in the database.','Template part "%s" already exists.'=>'Template part "%s" already exists.','Template part has no content.'=>'Template part has no content.','Template part not found or not stored in the database.'=>'Template part not found or not stored in the database.','Template Parts'=>'Template Parts','Templates'=>'Templates','Test connection'=>'Test connection','Testing…'=>'Testing…','Text domain / locale'=>'Text domain / locale','Text to translate'=>'Text to translate','The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Subsequent requests with identical inputs are served from the cache with no API call. The cache is different from Translation Memory: Translation Memory operates at the block level and is shared across posts; the API Response Cache operates at the feature level and is keyed per post.'=>'The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Subsequent requests with identical inputs are served from the cache with no API call. The cache is different from Translation Memory: Translation Memory operates at the block level and is shared across posts; the API Response Cache operates at the feature level and is keyed per post.','The editor did not accept the content — please try again.'=>'The editor did not accept the content — please try again.','The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above (default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation accuracy as full-page mode for snippets.'=>'The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above (default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation accuracy as full-page mode for snippets.','The phrase as it appears in the source text.'=>'The phrase as it appears in the source text.','The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure setting below.'=>'The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure setting below.','The source page has no footnotes.'=>'The source page has no footnotes.','The upload failed — please try again.'=>'The upload failed — please try again.','These footnotes come from the source page and are shown here for reference only. Add them to this page using the block editor.'=>'These footnotes come from the source page and are shown here for reference only. Add them to this page using the block editor.','This is the source page. Footnotes are edited directly in the block editor.'=>'This is the source page. Footnotes are edited directly in the block editor.','This key is currently supplied by a server %s and cannot be removed here. Enter a new key above to override it with a database value.'=>'This key is currently supplied by a server %s and cannot be removed here. Enter a new key above to override it with a database value.','Tip: to reset a model to the built-in default, clear the field and save.'=>'Tip: to reset a model to the built-in default, clear the field and save.','To use a custom encryption secret (instead of the derived wp_salt value), add this to wp-config.php:'=>'To use a custom encryption secret (instead of the derived wp_salt value), add this to wp-config.php:','Today'=>'Today','Token consumption rolled up by feature, provider, and model. Recorded on every successful AI call; Test Connection pings are deliberately excluded so they don\'t skew the totals. The underlying table aggregates daily — pick a window below to view it.'=>'Token consumption rolled up by feature, provider, and model. Recorded on every successful AI call; Test Connection pings are deliberately excluded so they don\'t skew the totals. The underlying table aggregates daily — pick a window below to view it.','Tone'=>'Tone','tone'=>'tone','Tone:'=>'Tone:','Too many AI requests. Please retry in %d seconds.'=>'Too many AI requests. Please retry in %d seconds.','Total'=>'Total','Total tokens'=>'Total tokens','Translate'=>'Translate','Translate / Revise'=>'Translate / Revise','Translate / Revise block'=>'Translate / Revise block','Translate all'=>'Translate all','Translate chunk'=>'Translate chunk','Translate Content'=>'Translate Content','Translate missing'=>'Translate missing','Translate page…'=>'Translate page…','Translated content'=>'Translated content','Translated Names'=>'Translated Names','Translated title'=>'Translated title','Translated to:'=>'Translated to:','Translated. Review in the Site Editor — internal links, navigation URLs, and template slugs are not updated automatically.'=>'Translated. Review in the Site Editor — internal links, navigation URLs, and template slugs are not updated automatically.','Translating…'=>'Translating…','Translation'=>'Translation','Translation Caching'=>'Translation Caching','Translation found but permalink could not be generated'=>'Translation found but permalink could not be generated','Translation Limits'=>'Translation Limits','Translation Limits & Behavior'=>'Translation Limits & Behavior','Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the month resets.'=>'Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the month resets.','Translation Memory'=>'Translation Memory','Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next translate call gets a fresh result.'=>'Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next translate call gets a fresh result.','Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed.'=>'Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed.' . "\0" . 'Translation Memory cleared. %d cached blocks were removed.','Translation Memory: stores the full translated post per content hash. Clear it when you want to force a retranslation of all posts regardless of whether their content changed.'=>'Translation Memory: stores the full translated post per content hash. Clear it when you want to force a retranslation of all posts regardless of whether their content changed.','Translation workflow'=>'Translation workflow','Translation, Content Generator'=>'Translation, Content Generator','Type'=>'Type','Uli Hake'=>'Uli Hake','Uninstall Behaviour'=>'Uninstall Behaviour','Uninstall setting saved.'=>'Uninstall setting saved.','unknown error'=>'unknown error','Unknown provider.'=>'Unknown provider.','Up'=>'Up','Upload .mo file'=>'Upload .mo file','Upload compiled .mo files to override third-party plugin strings for specific locales — for example, a custom VikBooking translation that uses "apartment" instead of "room". Files must follow the WordPress naming convention: {textdomain}-{locale}.mo (e.g. vikbooking-ca.mo). They are stored in the uploads folder and survive plugin updates.'=>'Upload compiled .mo files to override third-party plugin strings for specific locales — for example, a custom VikBooking translation that uses "apartment" instead of "room". Files must follow the WordPress naming convention: {textdomain}-{locale}.mo (e.g. vikbooking-ca.mo). They are stored in the uploads folder and survive plugin updates.','Upload Override'=>'Upload Override','URL could not be mapped to a post — check the link target exists'=>'URL could not be mapped to a post — check the link target exists','URL structure'=>'URL structure','URL structure: path-prefix mode (example.com/de/) requires no server changes. Subdomain mode (de.example.com) requires a wildcard DNS record, a wildcard SSL certificate, and a web server configuration change — see the Server Setup guide.'=>'URL structure: path-prefix mode (example.com/de/) requires no server changes. Subdomain mode (de.example.com) requires a wildcard DNS record, a wildcard SSL certificate, and a web server configuration change — see the Server Setup guide.','Use the tabs across the top of this page to configure each area. Changes to the Router tab take effect immediately; changes to AI keys and model settings apply to the next AI request.'=>'Use the tabs across the top of this page to configure each area. Changes to the Router tab take effect immediately; changes to AI keys and model settings apply to the next AI request.','User-managed terminology table per language pair. Entries are appended to the translation system prompt so the AI uses preferred terms consistently — critical for domain vocabulary ("kWp", "PPA", "interconnection point"), brand names that must not translate, and standardised regulatory phrasing. Both language fields are optional: leave "Source language" blank to apply the entry regardless of which language you are translating from; leave "Target language" blank to apply it to all target languages at once.'=>'User-managed terminology table per language pair. Entries are appended to the translation system prompt so the AI uses preferred terms consistently — critical for domain vocabulary ("kWp", "PPA", "interconnection point"), brand names that must not translate, and standardised regulatory phrasing. Both language fields are optional: leave "Source language" blank to apply the entry regardless of which language you are translating from; leave "Target language" blank to apply it to all target languages at once.','Using custom meta description.'=>'Using custom meta description.','View'=>'View','View built-in default'=>'View built-in default','View details'=>'View details','View Lingua Forge details'=>'View Lingua Forge details','Visit plugin site'=>'Visit plugin site','Warning:'=>'Warning:','When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter.'=>'When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter.','When enabled, first-time visitors with no language cookie and no language prefix in the URL are redirected to the closest matching language version. The redirect is skipped if the browser\'s preferred language is not among the active router languages. Once a visitor selects a language via the switcher, the cookie takes priority and the browser header is ignored on all future visits.'=>'When enabled, first-time visitors with no language cookie and no language prefix in the URL are redirected to the closest matching language version. The redirect is skipped if the browser\'s preferred language is not among the active router languages. Once a visitor selects a language via the switcher, the cookie takes priority and the browser header is ignored on all future visits.','Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and the content is short.'=>'Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and the content is short.','WP-CLI reference'=>'WP-CLI reference','Write AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting'=>'Write AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting','You can also define keys as constants or environment variables (e.g. in wp-config.php). Those sources are used automatically as a fallback when no database key is stored.'=>'You can also define keys as constants or environment variables (e.g., in wp-config.php). Those sources are used automatically as a fallback when no database key is stored.','You do not have permission to manage these settings.'=>'You do not have permission to manage these settings.','You do not have permission to read this post.'=>'You do not have permission to read this post.','{n} stale path(s)'=>'{n} stale path(s)','— Any source language —'=>'— Any source language —','— Any target language —'=>'— Any target language —','— Any target —'=>'— Any target —','— Any —'=>'— Any —','— auto-detect —'=>'— auto-detect —','— select a language —'=>'— select a language —','— toggle in Settings → Behavior.'=>'— toggle in Settings → Behavior.','← Back'=>'← Back','↑ Detected from current post'=>'↑ Detected from current post','↺ Re-translate'=>'↺ Re-translate','↺ Refine'=>'↺ Refine','↺ Refresh'=>'↺ Refresh','↺ Refreshing…'=>'↺ Refreshing…','⚠ Borderline'=>'⚠ Borderline','⚠ No <strong>{lang}</strong> posts found. Make sure all translated posts have their Language meta set to <strong>{lang}</strong> in the Language metabox.'=>'⚠ No <strong>{lang}</strong> posts found. Make sure all translated posts have their Language meta set to <strong>{lang}</strong> in the Language metabox.','⚠ No changes'=>'⚠ No changes','⚠ No changes — re-scan?'=>'⚠ No changes — re-scan?','✅ Fixed ({n})'=>'✅ Fixed ({n})','✅ No broken links or template mismatches found for <strong>{lang}</strong>. Scanned <strong>{scanned}</strong> post(s) and page(s) — all checks passed. Template part links (header, footer, sidebar) are not included here — use the Fix Template Parts button to check those separately.'=>'✅ No broken links or template mismatches found for <strong>{lang}</strong>. Scanned <strong>{scanned}</strong> post(s) and page(s) — all checks passed. Template part links (header, footer, sidebar) are not included here — use the Fix Template Parts button to check those separately.','✅ Template fixed'=>'✅ Template fixed','✓ All parts created.'=>'✓ All parts created.','✓ All templates created.'=>'✓ All templates created.','✓ All translated.'=>'✓ All translated.','✓ Configured'=>'✓ Configured','✓ Connection OK'=>'✓ Connection OK','✓ Content generated — see the overlay to review, refine, and apply.'=>'✓ Content generated — see the overlay to review, refine, and apply.','✓ Done'=>'✓ Done','✓ Enabled'=>'✓ Enabled','✓ Good length'=>'✓ Good length','✓ In safe storage'=>'✓ In safe storage','✓ Language installed.'=>'✓ Language installed.','✓ Links fixed.'=>'✓ Links fixed.','✓ Nav refs fixed.'=>'✓ Nav refs fixed.','✓ Parts fixed.'=>'✓ Parts fixed.','✓ Pattern translated.'=>'✓ Pattern translated.','✓ Refined — review the updated draft above.'=>'✓ Refined — review the updated draft above.','✓ Translation saved'=>'✓ Translation saved','✗ Disabled'=>'✗ Disabled','✗ Error:'=>'✗ Error:','✗ Failed:'=>'✗ Failed:','✗ Not configured'=>'✗ Not configured','✗ Too long'=>'✗ Too long','✗ Too short'=>'✗ Too short','❌ Failed'=>'❌ Failed','📄 Wrong template'=>'📄 Wrong template','📍 Stale path (page moved)'=>'📍 Stale path (page moved)']];
